      "text": "[8PM] #Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate\n\nVehicular traffic from Ragolis towards Benson and Ikorodu interchange is moving appreciably, while journey inward Ojubode is a little busy, due to pedestrians crossing and commercial activities. \n\nBetter movement inward Palace and Ojogbe. Return trip to Ojubode is steady moving. \n\nOjubode en route LG, Ladega to Itunmoja is light. Fast moving traffic towards Itunpate and Itunmeko, Otaona. \n\nOtaona to connect Mobil, Water corporation and Grammar school is good to go. Further movement inward Erunwen, Radio and Itamaga is free moving. \n\nFrom Ikorodu interchange to Aleje is light, while inward Sabo to Ile-epo Oba is encouraging. \n\nNavigating inward LASTMA yard, Sawmill, Okegbegun is in good shape. Steady movement when moving down to First and Second gate. \n\nBetter movement towards Flower and Jendol. While further movement is busy moving down to Odogunyan proper.",
