      "text": "[8:12PM] #Ajasa #Command #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement inward Ayobo and outward Megidah  is still appreciable.\nAmule, Oluwaganitoto, Oja till Church Roundabout is very good at the moment likewise the return journey.\n\nChurch Roundabout inward Adefemi is a moving traffic at the moment but a bit slow at  Oju Odo due to flash floods. It's then a jolly ride through Ikola till Command Sec. School.\n\nCommand through Whitehouse, Ile Iwe intersection, Omi Ata, Agbelekale is appreciable while with steady movements inward and outward Ekoro Junction; Movement to Abule Egba is good.\n\nEkoro Junction inward Captain, Iyana Meiran till Joke Ayo is a jolly ride likewise the return  journey.",
